1
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,039
Be gentle.

2
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:19,200
Those are cosmetics.

3
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,680
Ms. Liang,

4
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,240
you're finally here.

5
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:25,580
I've got the guest room ready for you.

6
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,920
How can you let me stay in the guest room?

7
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:32,360
I should be staying with He Yu, of course.

8
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,400
Silly me.

9
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,560
Since you're He Yu's fiancée,

10
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,759
you must stay with him.

11
00:01:40,759 --> 00:01:42,720
Take Ms. Liang's luggage...

12
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:44,560
Put it in the Second Young Master's room.

13
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,320
Yes.

14
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,200
Hurry up.

15
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,200
Zhang Xin actually

16
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,080
convinced the Master

17
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:52,479
to let Liang Chunsheng stay
at the He residence.

18
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:54,940
Now I have another
stumbling block in my way.

19
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,760
Second Young Master!

20
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,600
He Yu,

21
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:11,760
why is your room so empty?

22
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,730
You've already taken over.

23
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:20,280
Of course I have to give
the bedroom to you.

24
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,800
Do you hate me that much?

25
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:22,800
What do you think?

26
00:02:24,079 --> 00:02:25,140
It doesn't matter.

27
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,760
One day,

28
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,880
I will make you submit to me.

29
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,840
Suit yourself.

30
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,920
Since Miss Liang

31
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,520
has moved into the He family,

32
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,160
she is now

33
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,320
a part of our family.

34
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:50,880
Yu,

35
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:53,880
you need to take good care
of Miss Liang from now on.

36
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,320
Yu,

37
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,000
I want to eat that.

38
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,120
Yu,

39
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:21,940
Is that enough?

40
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,040
I'm full.

41
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,360
Master,

42
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,520
please calm down.

43
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,170
Have a seat, Miss Liang.

44
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,800
Feelings

45
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,360
need to be nurtured.

46
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,200
Yu is just not quite used to

47
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:39,280
living with someone else yet.

48
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,760
In my opinion,

49
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,000
it's better to let Mei

50
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,800
spend more time with Ms. Liang.

51
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:46,680
After all, Mei knows Yu best.

52
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:48,960
Sure,

53
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,820
I'd be happy to.

54
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,760
Before Xiaoyu and Ms. Liang get engaged,

55
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:55,560
you must attend to her every need.

56
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:25,960
How about it?

57
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,500
Wanna compete with me?

58
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,260
What do you want to compete in?

59
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,840
Li Zhangxin,

60
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,360
why are you trying to harm me?

61
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,640
Help!

62
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,960
Help!

63
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,120
Help!

64
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,280
He Yu,

65
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,480
did you see

66
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:14,480
how Li Zhangxin treated Miss Liang?

67
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,040
Go save her now!

68
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:18,800
As you wish.

69
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,420
Are you satisfied?

70
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,800
What else do you want
to compete with me for?

71
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,720
Hero saving the beauty,

72
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,760
I'll do it.

73
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:43,680
Who is it?

74
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:47,060
I'm saving you. What's wrong?

75
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:49,540
Where are you touching me?

76
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,320
He Shi,

77
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,000
let go!

78
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,880
He Shi!

79
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:57,170
Aren't you afraid the master
will whip you again, He Shi?

80
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,960
Help!

81
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,000
Let go of me!

82
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:05,840
He Shi!

83
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,800
Help!

84
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:07,600
He Shi!

85
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,560
He Shi, save me!

86
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,960
Letting you die like this

87
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,200
is too easy on you.

88
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,480
How could you bear

89
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,480
to leave me alone

90
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:45,000
in this long night?

91
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,920
You blocked me.

92
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,040
Playing hard to get.

93
00:06:58,640 --> 00:06:59,640
I like it.

94
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,520
Why is it you?

95
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,840
Don't you like my bed-warming service?

96
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:17,960
Get out.

97
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,560
Ms. Liang,

98
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:22,040
it'd be a pity

99
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,760
if no one appreciates

100
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,100
how beautifully you're dressed.

101
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,640
Roujing,

102
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:57,640
you did great.

103
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,200
I knew He Shi

104
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,860
couldn't keep it in his pants.

105
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:04,080
If we give the photos to Dad,

106
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,400
we can kick He Shi out.

107
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,040
Even if we blow this up,

108
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,280
knowing Dad,

109
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,600
he'll just cover it up.

110
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,500
Give them to Zhang Xin.

111
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,600
She'd never guess that

112
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:22,520
bringing Ms. Liang into the He family

113
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:25,040
was letting a fox into the henhouse.

114
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,400
Who took this?

115
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,650
I thought after the Master beat you up,

116
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:38,799
you would have learned your lesson.

117
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:39,919
I didn't expect

118
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,720
you to be even more brazen.

119
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:44,320
She seduced me.

120
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,000
I couldn't

121
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,320
control myself.

122
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,360
Do you think I'd believe you?

123
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,280
Let me tell you...

124
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,440
In this house,

125
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,480
even if you're having an affair,

126
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,000
it can only be with me.

127
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,100
Enjoy your meal, Miss.

128
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,480
You put the photo

129
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:13,360
in my room, didn't you?

130
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:17,080
I just wanted to let Mrs. He know.

131
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,400
Even if Miss Liang

132
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:21,000
marries the Second Young Master,

133
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,520
she will always maintain

134
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,080
an underground affair
with the Eldest Young Master.

135
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,840
Do you think He Shi

136
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:28,300
will still have you in his heart then?

137
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,920
He Shi and I

138
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:37,210
have had nothing to do
with each other for a long time.

139
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,480
Is that so?

140
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,340
Am I really that outstanding?

141
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,800
Li Zhangxin,

142
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,600
if you hadn't kicked me
out of the He family,

143
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:19,240
how would I have ended up like this?

144
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:42,800
Hello,

145
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,160
Mrs. He.

146
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,720
Long time no see.
